WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
The traditional method misses an obstacle and collides.
Simulation with illustrative interface and trajectories.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
LiDAR detects the obstacle. A VLM RGB check supports keeping it
in the refined scene context.

00:14.000 --> 00:21.000
The proposer considers braking, obstacle bypass, and reversing.
It selects obstacle bypass for verification.

00:21.000 --> 00:35.000
The runtime searches over forward distance, lateral offset, and speed.
The shared verifier rejects two candidates and admits the third.

00:35.000 --> 00:43.000
The executor begins the verified obstacle-bypass maneuver
while continuing to observe the scene.

00:43.000 --> 00:57.000
An oncoming vehicle triggers adaptation: return to the original lane earlier.
The revised maneuver passes verification.

00:57.000 --> 01:03.067
Continue driving with closed-loop observation and adaptation.
